    "detailed_description": "GHOST FAKE is an online multiplayer masked action game where players are divided into those with the power of the mask (The Masked) and survivors.<br><br>The Masked must conceal whether they possess a mask and act without being noticed by the other survivors. They seize opportunities to use the power of the mask and capture survivors.<br><br>On the other hand, survivors must escape from The Masked using gimmicks. It's important for survivors to cooperate in raising the level of the gimmicks and conserving the activation cost. Moreover, betraying one another among the survivors can also be a part of their strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Number of players</h2>2 to 4 players<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">First Mask Ability: Infection</h2>This mask transforms captured survivors into The Masked.",
    "about_the_game": "GHOST FAKE is an online multiplayer masked action game where players are divided into those with the power of the mask (The Masked) and survivors.<br><br>The Masked must conceal whether they possess a mask and act without being noticed by the other survivors. They seize opportunities to use the power of the mask and capture survivors.<br><br>On the other hand, survivors must escape from The Masked using gimmicks. It's important for survivors to cooperate in raising the level of the gimmicks and conserving the activation cost. Moreover, betraying one another among the survivors can also be a part of their strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Number of players</h2>2 to 4 players<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">First Mask Ability: Infection</h2>This mask transforms captured survivors into The Masked.",
    "short_description": "Multiplayer masked action game &quot;GHOST FAKE&quot; is an online game where players are divided into the masked ones and survivors to compete against each other. The masked ones use the power of the mask to capture survivors, while survivors use gimmicks to escape!",
